 of analytical techniques and various other skills for future research and thereby helping them in pursuing their carrier in this field\n•\tTo give opportunities to the students to develop their creativity and other activities\n•\tTo develop scientific as well as social temperament among the students\n•\tTo achieve excellence in teaching and research.\n•\tTo meet the challenges of a complex, and modern society through informed social outreach.\n•\tTo empower through knowledge and information.\n•\tTo develop, enhance, and improve the quality of human resources.\n•\tTo cultivate resolute moral and ethical values.\n•\tTo meet contemporary regional and national needs and anticipate future social and economic development.\n•\tTo preserve and promote cultural heritage, humanistic and spiritual values.\nFaculty Members\nDR. SAMIM SULTANA\nASSISTANT PROFESSOR\nsamimsultana786@gmail.com\nView Profile\nDR. ASHWINI BORAH\nASSISTANT PROFESSOR, HOD\nashwiniborahchem@gmail.com\nView Profile\nDR. RAKHIMONI BORAH\nASSISTANT PROFESSOR\nrakhi.borah2408@gmail.com\nView Profile\nEx- Faculty Members\nName\nDesignation\nDate of Joining\nDate of Retirement/Resign\nPhoto\nActivities\nID\nTitle\nDescription\nPublish\nView File\n59\nDEPARTMENTAL QUIZ\nChemistry Quiz\n2024-03-07\nView File\n62\nDEPARTMENTAL WALL MAGAZINE \"QUANTA\"\nFIRST EDITION\r\nTHEME: GREEN CHEMISTRY\n2024-02-17\nView File\n58\nDEPARTMENTAL QUIZ\nChemistry Quiz\n2023-09-19\nView File\n6\nFaculty cum Students (B.Sc 4th Semester, Chemistry Honours) exchange programme\nLectures were given by\r\n1.\tDr. Samim Sultana, Assistant Professor, Department of Chemistry, PDUAM, Tulungia and\r\n2.\tDr. Mitali Chetia, Assistant Professor, Department of Chemistry, Abhayapuri College\n2023-05-04\nView File\n5\nMoU signed with Department of Chemistry, Abhayapuri College, Abhayapuri\nTo work together for the greater interest of the students as well as Faculty Members concerned. \r\nThe institutions shall seek to promote-Faculty, Students 